message: "If you use these workshop materials, please cite this repository. Victoria Entz is credited as workshop co-presenter in the README."
type: software
title: "Build Securely. Grow Strategically: GitHub Profile Strategy Workshop"
abstract: >-
  Educational workshop materials for connecting a GitHub profile to career
  direction, evidence-linked project work, attribution and secure development.
  Includes a fork-and-clone profile lab, a USF AI Workshop case study, citation
  guidance and starter templates. Santos Martinez is the repository author.
  Santos Martinez and Victoria Entz are workshop co-presenters; co-presenter
  credit does not assert authorship of the original USF project.
